4. Fact + Dimension - Creating Star Schema
Fact- Business event + measurable values.
Example - sales_amount, quantity, discount, cost.
Dimension - Business context.
Example - customer, product, store, date.

5. Data Mart - A subject-oriented subset/layer of data designed for a specific business function or analytical use case.
